                  cbits -- Simple, finished C11 snippets
                  ======================================

These are minimal C snippets for solving common problems. They are complete and
finished; no updates are necessary and no updates will be provided. Some
changes may
be made, but they don't add new features
or correct bugs -- mostly, they just
correct typos and style. Therefore,you
can use them by simply copying them to your
project (and the licence terms make this
very easy).

They are written in standard C11/C17, and should also compile with C23,
although I haven't tested it. Some, but not all, snippets require a POSIX
environment. For further information, see the README files in the individual
directories.
